# Per-name overrides for the dev domain, in /etc/hosts format.
#
# You normally do NOT need to add anything here: the wildcard template in the
# Corefile already resolves every *.dev.internal name to DEV_HOST_IP, and Caddy
# routes by Host header. Use this file only when a name must point somewhere
# else — a service on another machine, or a NetBird peer.
#
# Examples:
#   100.90.1.42   staging.dev.internal
#   192.168.1.50  nas.dev.internal
